# Text is LF in every checkout, Windows included: the scripts run under bash, and the brand-asset lock
# (scripts/icons.ts) hashes text outputs byte for byte.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
# Every PR adds lines at the top of `## [Unreleased]`; git's built-in union driver keeps both sides
# instead of a conflict on every merge of main into a branch. Review the order after a merge.
CHANGELOG.md merge=union
